---
import NewSection from "./NewSection.astro";
---

<section class="padding_sec" id="about">
  <NewSection text="About" color="black" side="left" />
  <div class="about_info">
    <h2>Hello! My name is Gabrielle</h2>
    <p>
      I am currently studying Multimedia Design at Erhvervsakademi København, specializing in Front-End Development. I am passionate about technology and how digital solutions can improve communication and user experiences.

      <br /><br />

      I enjoy combining creativity, technical understanding, and user-centered design to develop functional and visually engaging digital solutions. I am particularly interested in exploring new technologies, including AI, and how they can support digital development and communication.

      <br /><br />

      Through my studies, personal projects, and internship at Modström, I have gained practical experience in web development, digital design, and e-commerce. I enjoy learning new skills, solving problems, and finding opportunities to improve digital experiences.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about_info {
    padding: var(--space-m) 0 var(--space-m) var(--space-xl);
    max-width: 65ch;

    p {
      padding-top: var(--space-xs);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .about_info {
      padding: var(--space-m) var(--space-xs) var(--space-m) var(--space-xs);
      max-width: 65ch;
    }
  }
</style>
